stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> created: NodeRuntime 构造
  created --> opening: Open()
  opening --> ready: Open ok
  opening --> failed: Open error
  ready --> running: BeginInvoke (RunSource / RunProcess / RunAsync)
  running --> ready: EndInvoke
  ready --> async_pending: EnterAsyncPending (在途达上限 / 等待归零)
  async_pending --> ready: TryLeaveAsyncPending (completion 释放槽位)
  ready --> draining: TryEnterDraining (输入结束 / kExhausted / stopping / retiring / cancelled)
  running --> draining: TryEnterDraining (in_flight==0)
  draining --> closing: EOS 全部送达 → CloseNode
  draining --> failed: FLUSH Process 返回错误
  closing --> closed: Close() 返回
  ready --> failed: Process 返回错误 (非 cancelled)
  running --> failed: Process 返回错误 (非 cancelled)
  created --> closed: AbandonCandidate / TryCloseCancelled
  closed --> [*]
  failed --> [*]

  note right of ready
    正交标志 (与 state 无关, 原子 bool):
    held      — Publish 期间 MUT-3 局部暂停
    retiring  — Drain 删除: 源下一轮 flush+EOS
    cancelled — Fast 删除 / Fast Stop: emit 被拒
    busy      — 有 Invoke 任务在栈上
  end note
